      "searchCoverage": "Official Grafana HTTP API authentication (Bearer service account token), current-organization GET /api/org, data source list/get-by-uid, alerting provisioning alert-rules and contact-points, Grafana Cloud stack URL format on grafana.net, Grafana Labs US identity, and dated incident search for Grafana Labs / Grafana Cloud security breach/incident reviewed on 2026-09-13. Historical GitHub-workflow (2025-04-26), Grafana Cloud Metrics Insights leak (2025-07-31), and TanStack/Shai-Hulud GitHub (2026-05) events are recorded; vendor reports Cloud production customer access was not obtained in the GitHub incidents and the Metrics leak was patched. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
